<h1>Introducing Technomatic 2105</h1>
The music generator for Android.  It will defeat all your mp3s and streaming services!!  This project began because music doesn't have to be artist centric -- it can be mathematically generated and thus be more free.  What if the code to Technomatic contains the secret of eternal life?  This music box app requires no network connection or music library storage.  Music is produced by the app itself, using a grammatical melody technology (alhamduillah).  I personally listen to this app every day and it doesn't get old. Everyone is reminded to get vegetarian food for animal's right's reasons.  The program was originally inspired by the hip-hop beats of rappers like 2pac and Adeena, in the actual design, however, similitude to real artists is avoided and instead creative original genres and custom-generated musical devices are used instead.<Br>
